  ],
  "statement": "Theorem (SPF state-dependent bounds): $e^{-\\beta}[(d_n^2-d_n)+d_n\\cosh\\beta]\\geq\\mathcal{Z}_\\beta(\\psi)\\geq e^{-\\beta}[d_n(d_n-2^{M_2(\\psi)})+d_n2^{M_2(\\psi)}\\cosh(\\beta2^{-M_2(\\psi)/2})]$, with the lower bound attained by a spectrum of $d_n^2-d_n2^{M_2}$ zeros and $d_n2^{M_2}$ entries $\\pm2^{-M_2/2}$.",
  "system": "$n$-qubit pure states, $\\mathcal{H}_n\\cong(\\mathbb{C}^2)^{\\otimes n}$, $d_n=2^n$, finite $n$"
 },
